{"title":"Black Walnut Crossbow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 41) · Monster drop: Thak Footman, Dune Skirmisher, Ogre Charger, Sirocco, Dune Marauder +6 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · DEX 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Crossbow</b> weapon skill</a>. No class starts with it. To learn it, finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-underleaf-the-heavy-bow\">The Heavy Bow</a></b> (the Archery Vendor by the targets in Underleaf, any class, level 10): free, and you keep the skill for good.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 41 <span class=\"muted\">(3643 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-wood\">Black Walnut Wood</a>, 9× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"grave-knight\" title=\"Grave Knight - dropped it in 1 of 9 looted corpses (1/9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/540c73fa0d52fe472906.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Grave Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"wraith\" title=\"Wraith - dropped it in 1 of 14 looted corpses (1/14)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/aeaf0aa4188ec64745fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wraith</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - dropped it in 1 of 22 looted corpses (1/22)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ff050e5359d57a891f04.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/22<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Sael Quickstring - dropped it in 3 of 300 looted corpses (1/100)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/491a153af36e89ea9f44.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sael Quickstring</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/100<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+6 more\">+6 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 5 of 1,185 looted corpses (1/237)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/237<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"Sirocco - dropped it in 1 of 296 looted corpses (1/296)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/296<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 2 of 1,439 looted corpses (1/720)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/720<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 1 of 771 looted corpses (1/771)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/771<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 834 looted corpses (1/834)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/834<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 850 looted corpses (1/850)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/850<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"black-walnut-crossbow\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=good\">Good <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=excellent\">Excellent <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-superior\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=superior\">Superior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"black-walnut-crossbow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"seeking\">Seeking</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>6.5–26.1 damage</td><td>-7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/9eb6bfca42dff868e02b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>7.5–29.9 damage</td><td>-4.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/black-walnut-crossbow?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=